<title>UNITED NATIONS: Honduras takes over presidency of U.N. council.</title>
<headline>Honduras takes over presidency of U.N. council.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambassador Gerardo Martinez Blanco of Honduras took over on Tuesday as president of the Security Council from ambassador Alfredo Lopes Cabral of Guinea-Bissau.</p>
<p>The post rotates monthly according to the English alphabetical order of the council's 15 member delegations.</p>
</text>
